      '<section class="purchase-stats-customer-section"><div><b>待購客戶明細</b><span>已全數抵銷 ' + purchaseStatsNumber(group.fullyCoveredCustomerCount) + ' 位／還在等 ' + purchaseStatsNumber(group.waitingCustomerCount) + ' 位</span></div>' + customerHtml + '</section>',
