  // 本機436：預購需求獨立工作列。進頁只載訂單骨架，按「開始統計」才下載產品目錄並計算四倉。
  function bindStandaloneOrderDemandPage() {
    var page = document.querySelector('[data-order-demand-page]');
    if (!page || page.dataset.orderDemandBound === '1') return;
    page.dataset.orderDemandBound = '1';
    var host = page.querySelector('[data-order-demand-summary]');
    var toggle = page.querySelector('[data-order-demand-toggle]');
    var controls = page.querySelector('[data-order-demand-controls]');
    var overview = page.querySelector('[data-order-demand-overview]');
    var grid = page.querySelector('[data-order-demand-grid]');
    page.addEventListener('click', function (event) {
      var shortageConfirm = event.target.closest('[data-order-demand-shortage-confirm]');
      if (shortageConfirm) {
        event.preventDefault();
        confirmOrderDemandShortage(shortageConfirm.getAttribute('data-order-demand-shortage-confirm'), shortageConfirm);
        return;
      }
      var pageMove = event.target.closest('[data-order-demand-page-move]');
      if (pageMove) {
        orderDemandPage += pageMove.getAttribute('data-order-demand-page-move') === 'next' ? 1 : -1;
